  "protocol": "Taiko",
  "name": "Taiko SGX attestation accepts DEBUG-mode enclaves",
  "summary": "Taiko's AutomataDcapV3Attestation checked a quote's MRENCLAVE and MRSIGNER but not its attributes, so DEBUG-mode enclaves passed. With the raiko MRSIGNER key leaked publicly, the attacker ran trusted raiko builds in debug mode, registered SGX-GETH and SGX-RETH instances with readable keys and used forged proofs and bridge messages to drain the L1 Bridge and ERC20Vault.",
