  "notes": [
    "The SGX-GETH attestation proxy trusted nothing until config tx 0xa5cfcd6c, which trusted MRSIGNER 0xca0583a7 (the leaked key), the anchor's MRENCLAVE 0xfda8bb1f, TCB and QE identity. SGX-RETH trusted that MRSIGNER at 19966171; later MRENCLAVE additions were not needed, as older builds stayed trusted.",
    "Campaign: 29 forged checkpoint proofs and 36 processMessage/retryMessage txs by the attacker through block 25370061, plus c0ffeebabe's front-run of forged message 9000 (kept 18 ETH fee). Loss is exact L1 Bridge and ERC20Vault depletion, at DefiLlama prices nearest first release.",
    "The exploit also needed the leaked enclave signing key (offchain); admission rests on the onchain attestation defect, without which a DEBUG quote could not register."
  ],
